Circuit Connection Details

Arduino Nano + HC-SR04 + 0.96" OLED

HC-SR04 Ultrasonic Sensor
----------------------------------------------

HC-SR04	         Arduino Nano
VCC	----------------5V
GND	----------------GND
TRIG---------------	D2
ECHO---------------	D3

0.96" OLED I2C Display
--------------------------------------------

OLED	          Arduino Nano

VCC----------------5V*
GND----------------GND
SDA	---------------A4
SCL	---------------A5

*Use 3.3V instead if your particular OLED module is rated only for 3.3V.

Communication:
-------------------------------------------
HC-SR04 → Digital pins D2, D3
OLED → I2C pins A4 (SDA), A5 (SCL)
All components must share common GND.
